====A Tribute for Tectonix====
The southern island serves as a gravesite for an {{p|Onix}}, [[Nickname|nicknamed]] Tectonix by its loving Trainer. The memorial itself is a large rock pillar shaped like an Onix's tail. Its Trainer can be found here, spending time with his dearly departed Pokémon and cleaning the memorial. If you examine the pillar and leave a can of Tectonix's favorite drink, [[Lemonade]], the man thanks you for your kindness with {{TM|42|Facade}}.

{{m|Fly}} back to the town of [[Five Island (town)|Five Island]] and be sure to make room in your party before heading north.

