====A Joyful Gift====
The tiny islet has only Pokémon Breeder Alize and an elderly Gentleman. Speak to him to receive a [[Pokémon Egg]], if the lead Pokémon in your party has maximum [[friendship]]. The Egg will eventually hatch into a {{p|Togepi}}.

